OL,3,GNEWSARecord-breaking donations made to
OL,4,AChristmas appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record-breaking number of toys have
OL,7,Fbeen donated to a Christmas appeal
OL,8,Flaunched by BBC Radio Suffolk.
OL,10,FMore than 3,800 toys, ranging from
OL,11,Fdolls and cuddly toys to jigsaws and
OL,12,Fboardgames, have been handed in to
OL,13,Flibraries across the county since the
OL,14,Fstart of November.
OL,16,FThe goods were donated by residents and
OL,17,Fbusinesses across Suffolk and will be
OL,18,Fdistributed to families via charities.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
